From d6d2bbdbb90b0d5f92868f62ead7490348992254 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:03:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] VAX8200: DMB32 VAXBI communications interface (async,
 printer); shared printer formatter

The DMB32 (device DMB, BI node 5): BI node with self-test, 8 async lines
with DMA (VAX page table translation by the board), printer port, sync
line registers (DDCMP engine waits for a VMS SIDRIVER).  Device-supplied
BI vectors in vax820_bi.c (known issues case 67).  The DMF32 printer and
the DMB32 printer share vax_combo_lib.c.  BICSR_HES fixed (case 66).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Suavtcc46vFhoyQ1F6AQu4
